384	## Getting Started
385	
386	Once Desktop Commander is installed and Claude Desktop is restarted, you're ready to supercharge your Claude experience!
387	
388	### 🚀 New User Onboarding
389	
390	Desktop Commander includes intelligent onboarding to help you discover what's possible:
391	
392	**For New Users:** When you're just getting started (fewer than 10 successful commands), Claude will automatically offer helpful getting-started guidance and practical tutorials after you use Desktop Commander successfully.
393	
394	**Request Help Anytime:** You can ask for onboarding assistance at any time by simply saying:
395	- *"Help me get started with Desktop Commander"*
396	- *"Show me Desktop Commander examples"* 
397	- *"What can I do with Desktop Commander?"*
398	
399	Claude will then show you beginner-friendly tutorials and examples, including:
400	- 📁 Organizing your Downloads folder automatically
401	- 📊 Analyzing CSV/Excel files with Python
402	- ⚙️ Setting up GitHub Actions CI/CD
403	- 🔍 Exploring and understanding codebases
404	- 🤖 Running interactive development environments
