# F2C MCP Server 
![MCP Server](https://badge.mcpx.dev?type=server 'MCP Server')
[![smithery badge](https://smithery.ai/badge/@f2c-ai/f2c-mcp)](https://smithery.ai/server/@f2c-ai/f2c-mcp)
